OL,3,GNEWSABonfire burns victim still feels
OL,4,Apain two years on
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who suffered flash flame burns
OL,7,Ffrom a garden bonfire said she still
OL,8,Ffeels pain two years after the
OL,9,Faccident.
OL,11,FMaureen Pickles, from Almondsbury near
OL,12,FBristol, said she remembers little of
OL,13,Fthe incident, which happened as she was
OL,14,Fbuilding a bonfire in her garden, apart
OL,15,Ffrom being "immediately aware I was on
OL,16,Ffire".
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
