OL,3,GNEWSABonfire burns victim still feels
OL,4,Apain two years on
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe said she was on her own at the
OL,7,Ftime, but her neighbours heard her
OL,8,Fyells for help, and the next thing she
OL,9,Fknew she was meeting burns consultant
OL,10,FChris Wearn when she woke up in
OL,11,FSouthmead Hospital.
OL,13,F"Without them [the neighbours] I
OL,14,Fprobably wouldn't be here," Pickles
OL,15,Ftold BBC Radio Bristol.
